  "body": "test code:\r\n```js\r\nconst p = new URLPattern({ pathname: '/:foo.' });\r\nconsole.log(p.test({pathname: \"/bar.\"}));\r\nconsole.log(p.test({pathname: \"/bar\"}));\r\n```\r\nChrome:\r\n```\r\ntrue\r\nfalse\r\n```\r\nurlpattern-polyfill:\r\n```\r\ntrue\r\ntrue\r\n```\r\ndeno currently panics, but with a quick fix for the panic, i reach same result as urlpattern-polyfill. Is something missing in the spec?",
